n -2144 -1024 -1664 -672 100
This schematic contains the following
systemwide Command Action Directive
(CAD) records for the NIRI:
.
observe  - Begin an observation.
.
pause    - Pause an observation.
.
continue - Continue an observation.
.
stop     - Stop an observation.
.
abort    - Abort an observation.
_
